{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "早歩きが得意ですが、\nそんな私も雨の日は慎重に歩みを進めます。\nすべりやすいので、気をつけながら歩きましょうね…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんこんばんは。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日向坂46 かみむら ひなのです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日は、18枚目シングル「イチャイチャ虫」の発売日。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobIYL0gP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "SHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんB2Fにて、パネル展を開催していただいております。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも素敵な展示を有難うございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobkafpkR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でっかいパネルと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobE76VCS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でっかいハートも！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobn7aZfJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はるかチャンと隣ー！\nファンタジー界隈🧚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobpVqmP9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まりぃちゃんロード✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "期間は10/5(月) までとなっております！\n皆さんも是非行ってみてね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーおしらせー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢本日9月30日(水)発売\n「BUBKA」11月号に登場させていただいております。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みくに、まりぃと三期生対談。これまでのこと、これからのことをお話しました。\nまさかの涙有り！！の激アツ対談になりました。笑\n表紙・巻頭は松尾桜ちゃん、中面には下田衣珠季！山下葉留花 のインタビューも掲載されています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非チェックよろしくお願いします📗"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢18枚目シングル五期生楽曲\n「それでもいつか」MVが公開になりました。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobYnf8OF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "センターは下田衣珠季ちゃん！\nみんなの表情がとっても素敵…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/uVgPrRdq4QU?si=Qafz3S5bFgHDv6Mv"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MV是非ご覧ください✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "18枚目シングル「イチャイチャ虫」\n魅力的なカップリング曲も沢山！\n是非沢山聴いてね~\nどんどん好きになってください❤️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは本日はこの辺で！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "〜読んでくださってありがとうございました〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobS7vuFM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "上村ひなの\n973,#ひなのなのぶろぐ"}], "source": "official"}